const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"研究问题",en:"Research question"},body:{zh:"论文研究媒体覆盖与股票收益横截面，关键在于哪些公司和新闻来源被纳入覆盖度量。 阅读时应把它理解为受样本、时点和制度限定的问题，而不是可以脱离条件的结论。",en:"The article studies media coverage and the cross-section of stock returns, requiring attention to which firms and news sources enter the coverage measure. Read it as a bounded question, not as a conclusion that automatically travels beyond its sample, dates, or institutional setting."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2009.01493.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"研究设计",en:"Research design"},body:{zh:"它将覆盖度量与横截面收益结果关联，来源选择、实体匹配、发布时间和组合形成均是核心设计选择。 比较对象、观察窗口和对照关系共同构成研究合同；改变其中一项，可能改变所检验的命题。",en:"It relates a coverage measure to cross-sectional return outcomes, so source selection, entity matching, publication timing, and portfolio formation are core design choices. The comparison, observation window, and control relation are part of the research contract; changing one can change the proposition being tested."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2009.01493.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"数据与时点",en:"Data and timing"},body:{zh:"输入包括原始媒体内容或合法覆盖档案、首次发布时间、公司身份、收益与退市数据、覆盖聚合和样本成员。 字段定义、可得时点和样本筛选需要与原研究分别记录，不能仅因变量同名或使用最新修订值就视为可比。",en:"Inputs include original media items or a licensed coverage archive, first-publication timestamps, firm identifiers, return and delisting data, coverage aggregation, and sample membership. Keep fields, availability timing, and sample filters separate from the original study: a same-named variable or later-revised database is not automatically comparable."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2009.01493.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"如何理解结果",en:"How to read the result"},body:{zh:"论文研究历史覆盖—收益关系；新闻公开可见并不使覆盖成为普适、因果或可交易信号。 它只支持来源所描述的经验或理论关系，不能把相关性、模型拟合或历史表现升级为因果、可执行性或未来保证。",en:"The paper examines a historical coverage-return relation; public visibility of news does not turn coverage into a universal, causal, or tradable signal. This remains the empirical or theoretical relation described by the source; it does not turn association, fit, or historical performance into causality, an executable procedure, or a future guarantee."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2009.01493.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"复核清单",en:"Replication checks"},body:{zh:"保留来源权限与版本；去除转载；汇总前映射实体；区分首次可见与后续编辑；使用时点证券样本。 开展后续分析前，应将这些选择写入版本化研究记录，并保留原始来源链接与访问日期。",en:"Keep source permissions and versions; deduplicate syndication; map entities before aggregation; separate first-seen time from later edits; use point-in-time security universes. Before extending the analysis, record these choices in a versioned note and retain the primary-source link and access date."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2009.01493.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · source description"}}},{title:{zh:"适用边界",en:"Scope boundary"},body:{zh:"该条导读引用 The Journal of Finance (2009)。新闻生态、语言、访问规则和发布时间滞后不同会改变度量；这不是再分发权或当前收益预测。 如需数值结论、参数、表格或稳健性检验，请回到原文并单独核对版本、附录与样本定义。",en:"This guide cites The Journal of Finance (2009). Different news ecosystems, languages, access rules, and publication lags can change the measure, so this is not a redistribution right or a current return forecast. For numerical conclusions, parameters, tables, or robustness tests, return to the original and separately verify the edition, appendices, and sample definitions."},reference:{url:"https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1540-6261.2009.01493.x",label:{zh:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · 来源说明",en:"The Journal of Finance (2009) · source description"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"本文只整理“Media Coverage and the Cross-section of Stock Returns”公开说明的研究对象与设计边界，不构成收益预测、交易规则或全文复现。新闻生态、语言、访问规则和发布时间滞后不同会改变度量；这不是再分发权或当前收益预测。",en:"This guide only organizes the publicly described question and design of “Media Coverage and the Cross-section of Stock Returns”. It is not a return forecast, trading rule, or full-text replication. The source's stated scope remains controlling."}};export{e as default};
